<title>HONG KONG: Cathay Pacific names Heale's replacement.</title>
<headline>Cathay Pacific names Heale's replacement.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cathay Pacific Airways Ltd said on Wednesday it has appointed Philip Chen, director and chief operating officer of Hong Kong Dragon Airlines, as deputy managing director, replacing Simon Heale.</p>
<p>The appointment will be effective in mid-March 1997, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Heale will take over as finance director of Swire Pacific Ltd, Cathay Pacific's parent Swire Group announced earlier.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
